.TH SDL_THREAD_ANNOTATION_ATTRIBUTE__ 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_THREAD_ANNOTATION_ATTRIBUTE__ \- Enable thread safety attributes, only with clang.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_mutex.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_THREAD_ANNOTATION_ATTRIBUTE__(x)   __attribute__((x))
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The attributes can be safely erased when compiling with other compilers\[char46]
.PP
To enable analysis, set these environment variables before running cmake:

.IP
.EX
export CC=clang
export CFLAGS="-DSDL_THREAD_SAFETY_ANALYSIS -Wthread-safety"
.EE
.PP

